  "description": "Jin Ju-hyun, the boss of Busan's largest faction, \"Juseonghoe.\" One day, after receiving an insider's tip, he heads to his hometown, Jinju in Gyeongsangnam-do. There, he encounters the owner of a guesthouse, Hyeon Jin-joo, and begins to dream of an ordinary life for the first time. However, the more he dreams of a new life, the more the relentless ties with the past underworld drag him into an unavoidable and desperate struggle.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=818588), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10393129)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003499)",
